  "en": "Take this \"Fiend\" character\nthat Luther defeated during\nthe War of the Reapers.",
  "fr": "Prenez ce personnage\n\"Démoniaque\" que Luther a battu\fpendant la Guerre des\nmoissonneurs.",
  "src": "pinky",
  "relu": true
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Cuisses",
  "en": "Well, supposedly he's found his\nway back into our world.",
  "fr": "Eh bien, soi-disant qu'il aurait\ntrouvé le moyen de revenir dans\fnotre monde.",
  "src": "pinky",
  "relu": true
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "What!",
  "fr": "Quoi !",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Richard",
  "en": "The Fiend...\nYou mean Gilvaroth!",
  "fr": "Le Démon...\nTu parles de Gilvaroth !",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Richard",
  "en": "No...it can't be...",
  "fr": "Non... c'est impossible...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Cuisses",
  "en": "It can, and it is. The Fiend,\nGilvaroth, has come back to life.",
  "fr": "C'est possible et vrai. Le Démon,\nGilvaroth, est revenu à la vie.",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Cuisses",
  "en": "And worse than that...",
  "fr": "Et pire que ça...",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Cuisses",
  "en": "his reaper servants are\nawakening, one by one.",
  "fr": "Ses serviteurs les moissonneurs se\nréveillent,\fles uns après les autres.",
  "src": "pinky",
  "relu": true
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Then that means... Roger!",
  "fr": "Alors ça signifie que... Roger !",
  "src": "pinky"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Cuisses",
  "en": "Yes. One of the reapers was\nsleeping inside him all the while.",
  "fr": "Oui.\fUn des moissonneurs était\nendormi en lui pendant tout ce\ftemps.",
  "src": "pinky",
  "relu": true
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Cuisses",
  "en": "The others sleep inside France's\nnobility and other powerful folk.",
  "fr": "Les autres sommeillent dans des\nnobles français et d'autres\fpersonnalités influentes.",
  "src": "pinky",
  "relu": true
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST3051BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "What?!\nThen King Charles is in peril!",
